    "questions": [
      {
        "question": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "A study was conducted to investigate the effect of a new medication on systolic blood pressure. Blood pressure was measured for 8 patients before and after taking the medication:"
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "headers": [
              "Participant",
              "Pre-Treatment BP (mmHg)",
              "Post-Treatment BP (mmHg)"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "1",
                "140",
                "130"
              ],
              [
                "2",
                "150",
                "142"
              ],
              [
                "3",
                "135",
                "128"
              ],
              [
                "4",
                "160",
                "152"
              ],
              [
                "5",
                "145",
                "138"
              ],
              [
                "6",
                "155",
                "148"
              ],
              [
                "7",
                "148",
                "142"
              ],
              [
                "8",
                "142",
                "135"
              ]
            ],
            "align": [
              "left",
              "right",
              "right"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "Please determine if the medication has a significant effect on reducing blood pressure at alpha = 0.05."
          }
        ],
        "answer": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "令 $d=\\mathrm{Pre}-\\mathrm{Post}$, $H_0:\\mu_d=0$, $H_1:\\mu_d>0$. 差值为 10,8,7,8,7,7,6,7, $\\bar d=7.5$, $s_d=1.1952$, $SE=0.4226$, $t=17.7482$, $df=7$. 单侧临界值 $t_{0.95,7}=1.8946$, 拒绝 $H_0$, 数据支持平均收缩压降低"
          }
        ],
        "explanation": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "题目问 reducing, 使用预先指定的单侧配对 t 检验; 若课程要求双侧检验, 临界值为 2.3646, 结论相同. 检验假设为差值近似正态且受试者独立, 该前后比较本身不足以单独排除时间等混杂因素"
          }
        ],
        "sources": [
          {
