      {
        "question": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "Suppose you want to test whether smoking status is associated with lung disease in a sample of 200 individuals."
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "headers": [
              "",
              "Lung Disease",
              "No Disease",
              "Total"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "Smoker",
                "60",
                "40",
                "100"
              ],
              [
                "Non-smoker",
                "30",
                "70",
                "100"
              ],
              [
                "Total",
                "90",
                "110",
                "200"
              ]
            ],
            "align": [
              "left",
              "right",
              "right",
              "right"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "Please fill the following table with expected frequencies and perform a Chi-square test at alpha = 0.05 (keep two decimals during your calculation)."
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "headers": [
              "",
              "Lung Disease",
              "No Disease"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "Smoker",
                "",
                ""
              ],
              [
                "Non-smoker",
                "",
                ""
              ]
            ],
            "align": [
              "left",
              "left",
              "left"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "answer": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "期望频数为 $\\begin{pmatrix}45.00&55.00\\\\45.00&55.00\\end{pmatrix}$. $H_0$: 吸烟状态与肺病独立. Pearson $\\chi^2=18.1818$, $df=1$, $p\\approx0.0000201$, 大于 5% 临界值 3.8415, 拒绝 $H_0$, 两变量存在统计关联"
          }
        ],
        "explanation": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "$E_{ij}=R_iC_j/N$, $\\chi^2=\\sum(O-E)^2/E$, 此处为未作 Yates 连续性校正的 Pearson 检验, 四格期望频数均大于 5"
          }
        ],
        "sources": [
